-- MAGIC # Workload Refactoring
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC The Data Intelligence platform wouldn’t do much for anyone without workloads, and in a Unity Catalog upgrade scenario, those all need some degree of attention to ensure that they work as expected with data and AI assets managed by Unity Catalog. 
