-- COMMAND ----------

-- MAGIC %md
-- MAGIC ## C. Cluster and Job Configuration
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Classic clusters must be configured with the following settings for UC compatibility:
-- MAGIC - **DBR:** 11.3 LTS or above
-- MAGIC - **Access mode:** *Standard* or *Dedicated*
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Jobs should be configured to run as (owner) a suitably permitted service principal.

-- COMMAND ----------

-- MAGIC %md
-- MAGIC ## D. Principals
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Identity management moves from workspace-local to account-level: Workspace-local groups must be migrated, merging if needed, and any changes must be reflected in code.
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Any membership checks (using `is_member()`) should be updated to use `is_account_group_member()` for proper compatibility with account-level groups.
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC Any jobs being migrated should have suitably permitted service principals as owners.

